							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">i know in the drum and bass scene in seattle one of the things that really started to get it known as one of the best scenes around the country was when a few guys started an internet radio show featuring local dj&#039;s and MCs.&nbsp; I wonder if something like that could get started.&nbsp; Get a one or two hour weekly show with a regular group of djs hosting it and helping manage and promote it and feature other guest sets by local artists or visting artists on tour.&nbsp; it could be a good way to plug and promote local shows and shows of local artists touring and for promoting different community activities, rallies protests such...<br /><br />anyone think this could fly??</div>
